WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.114
Bees flew all around the Throne Room.

2
00:00:08.115 --> 00:00:14.557
They landed on the queen's book.

3
00:00:14.558 --> 00:00:18.562
They tried to fly up the king's nose.

4
00:00:18.563 --> 00:00:21.037
Princess Mary looked scared.

5
00:00:21.038 --> 00:00:23.899
"Help!" she cried.

6
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.385
"The bees will sting me!"

7
00:00:26.386 --> 00:00:29.522
The queen gasped.

8
00:00:29.523 --> 00:00:34.006
"A bee sting will kill Mary!" she said.

9
00:00:34.007 --> 00:00:36.700
"Shoo those bees away!"

10
00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:40.965
Everybody shooed bees away from the princess.

11
00:00:40.966 --> 00:00:48.838
"Bees don't like water," the prince said.

12
00:00:48.839 --> 00:00:52.708
He threw a bucket of water at the princess.

13
00:00:52.709 --> 00:00:55.843
The bees buzzed loudly.

14
00:00:55.844 --> 00:00:58.670
They flew around the princess.

15
00:00:58.671 --> 00:01:03.111
"Wizard! Make the bees flee!" the king cried.

16
00:01:03.112 --> 00:01:07.192
Tom lifted his wand.

17
00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:11.331
"Bees don't like to be inside," Cat whispered.

18
00:01:11.332 --> 00:01:14.894
"They like flowers."

19
00:01:14.895 --> 00:01:18.703
Cat opened a window.

20
00:01:18.704 --> 00:01:21.068
Tom waved his wand.

21
00:01:21.069 --> 00:01:30.811
"Bees, go where you please!" he cried.

22
00:01:30.812 --> 00:01:38.114
The bees flew out the window.

23
00:01:38.115 --> 00:01:41.103
The princess smiled at Tom.

24
00:01:41.104 --> 00:01:44.396
"You saved me!" she said.

25
00:01:44.397 --> 00:01:47.813
Tom turned red.

26
00:01:47.814 --> 00:01:53.651
Dirk came back to the Throne Room.

27
00:01:53.652 --> 00:01:57.417
Dirk was very dirty from cleaning the dungeon.

28
00:01:57.418 --> 00:02:01.845
"Er," Dirk mumbled. "That cat can stay.

29
00:02:01.846 --> 00:02:04.233
The rats brought the fleas.

30
00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:10.048
And Cat scared all the rats away."

31
00:02:10.049 --> 00:02:13.675
The queen took a deep sniff.

32
00:02:13.676 --> 00:02:16.405
She waved a hand in the air.

33
00:02:16.406 --> 00:02:19.716
"You stink, Dirk!" she said.

34
00:02:19.717 --> 00:02:37.278
"Go take another bath!"

